      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Steam has something like this, where we can turn on a notification that tells me when a friend comes online. It can be set on a per-friend basis.\n\nWe can already sort of do this by favoriting someone and just constantly checking our friend list, so why not automate this and save anyone who may have the OCD to constantly check their friend list.\n\nIt may be worthwhile to consider a \"Friend Now-Joinable\" Notification that plays a small noise when the friend moves to a joinable instance, incase they finally jumped out of that busy-status private world after half a day.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
